    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Lyanne Sabetta",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116037788898145903058/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWZlPQKJuRydPmybae7VKXsw8yXZIOp2jHsEYEmuxbBdvX3hwyg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "This was my first visit .. I am beyond impressed !! The removal of my old gel nails was seedless and pain free ..  the person I had Johnny was very polite - listened to what I requested - gave his thoughts and ensure I was happy each step of the process .. definitely will be returning",
        "time": 1767665321,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jannie S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104127748316462054855/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI8loQQ0sV4yOh4D1J0yA64SePXT6MTsQVG5ErS6ax4ywcVjaYx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Tracy was fantastic!\nShe did an amazing job in shaping the nails and replicated the picture I showed her.\n\nVera did an excellent pedicure.\nShaped them nicely ( not as easy on toes)\nAnd her mini massage ( she saw my feet were swollen ) was really appreciated.\n\nThank you ladies !",
        "time": 1769257942,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Latifah Bakush",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106894279699933355677/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKxUvWpbV2BN4OWJYBn2tpFKdkjVYb_Mm_l3jY0CReRf9pS9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I had a really bad experience here and it was my first time. The high reviews really fooled me but upon looking further I think they could be fake. From the beginning I asked for pointy and he did coffin. I kept asking him if he can change it and he said he would until almost the end I asked why it still was incorrect. He said pointy was not nice on my fingers and coffin is better, which was really rude because I get pointy all the time and I like it. Then he finally listened and had to file like crazy to get the shape I asked for in the beginning. It was uncomfortable and painful. Atleast 5 of my fingers on the side had a cut on it from the abrasion of the nail filing and two bled. It was not a pleasant experience at all. The shape didn’t even end up being what I wanted they were more like almond and very uneven and ugly. Organic nails but nothing is actually organic and I highly doubt the tools are properly cleaned. Overall I will not go back and I do not recommend. I paid $75 (which is more expensive than I usually pay) and even tipped them $5 because I always feel bad to not tip but they truly did not deserve it and it was the last time I ever go there.",
        "time": 1757179067,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carolyn Stern",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105526188989721733570/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWk1HoYYGSFZNeKHR0OLLwk-AWqLry8EqmTmP_RJER63wtaOpuu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Johnny is very meticulous and does a great job on my gel nails. The pedicures are always relaxing and they give great foot and leg  massages.",
        "time": 1765570782,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "oceanne belanger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100697737952939361670/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUN3jPZr1b2gUGimm0uvkuKwwvc-Ns32QlNHgbCRqCAAN3xUv4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
